            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-25T15:26:49.364192+00:00",
            "notes": "normally i don't even make it to round 7 bc we've either won or lost by then LOL power this round is v subjective to the match, but items are normally the same!! i'll grab champion's kit for the ability power, which helps my flash heal as well as my rez if i go first responder. \n\n- if i know i'm getting off a rez, i'll go first responder bc overhealth for me and rez target is huge, and this is normally my go to!\n\n- sympathetic recovery is normally my second go to, the self heal is so nice and keeps me up which means my team stays up.  \n\n- distortion is really only if my team is sweeping the other team, i love getting lifesteal so they can get a bit more survivability as well :3\n\n- supply surge is kind of a last resort? the reduced cd is nice as well as the reloaded ammo, and the movement speed helps to get them in/out of fights easier.  not my favorite power tho, just bc its a separate keybind and by this time, i'm used to not having it so i often forget about it :3",
